`,readingTime:{minutes:2.44,words:731}},{path:"/article/c1p3mpe4/",title:"MCP 探索笔记：查找与管理你需要的 MCP",tags:["AI","mcp","工具"],createTime:"2025/04/05 04:35:45",lang:"zh-CN",excerpt:`
